{"id":"0f7fd19603cd4cce","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-negation-equivalence-condition.md","title":"内外否定等价恰需确定性","display":"lem-negation-equivalence-condition — 内外否定等价恰需确定性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-negation-equivalence-condition","aliases":["91-lem-negation-equivalence-condition","91-lem-neg-equiv-cond"],"display":"lem-negation-equivalence-condition — 内外否定等价恰需确定性","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-negation]]","[[91-df-external-negation]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-negation-equivalence-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-negation-equivalence-condition</span><span>91-lem-neg-equiv-cond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-negation-equivalence-condition — 内外否定等价恰需确定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e369e02605242bf1\" href=\"?note=e369e02605242bf1\" title=\"91-df-internal-negation\">91-df-internal-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c8fb2a4f3910429\" href=\"?note=2c8fb2a4f3910429\" title=\"91-df-external-negation\">91-df-external-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (一致的强 Kleene 固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 不同时包含一个句子及其否定的编码)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\)</span> (把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 经典解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的外层结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\lor\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\lor\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>\n(在信息一致前提下，恰有一方进入的确定性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}negation\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}negation\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在外层经典结构中，左式的左边为真当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，右边为真当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span>。对一致固定点，两者等价\n恰好意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 的编码有且只有一个属于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>正出现只保证相关算子对信息扩张单调，并不保证句子已确定。因此把\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是正公式”当作内外否定等价的充分条件是错误的。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"e369e02605242bf1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-negation","status":"resolved","id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\n\\lor\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}negation\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e369e02605242bf1","2c8fb2a4f3910429","2bc1263010e83604"]}